    "body": "Quick pass on head `cfadf347b36e21b30893dd55a72f22e4937650d1`. This pass reads the PR and does not build.\n\n- The PR is stacked on #2023 and merges cleanly with its base branch.\n- The author's gate is green on this head: the five tests of `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/lathe_gizmo.rs`, the filters `lathe_`, `law_tests`, `axis_note`, `wcs_gizmo` and `structural`, and clippy on `camcraft-ui`.\n- The body has the screenshots, the `Changelog:` line and the closing line. The decision is in `docs/decisions/2019-lathe-gizmo.md`.\n- Before #2023 merges, the merging session retargets this PR to `main`.\n\nThe PR is ready for the independent review.\n",
